{"schemaVersion":1,"year":2022,"currency":"USD","scope":"Total uncollected assessed contributions for current and prior years","source":{"symbol":"A/79/494","url":"https://unsceb.org/assets/media/reports/report-3825-A79494-Budgetary-and-financial-situation-of-the-organizations-of-the-UN-system-2024.pdf","sha256":"730715bea7528175c5edffbeac4fcae82f7692ec5de922f393a06d125ff8e9cb","table":7,"pdfPages":[29,30],"notes":[{"marker":"a","text":"The percentage collected as at 30 June and as at 31 December reflects the current fiscal year’s assessments.","pdfPage":30,"years":[2022,2023]},{"marker":"b","text":"The amount outstanding reflects total uncollected assessments for all years (namely, current and prior).","pdfPage":30,"years":[2022,2023]},{"marker":"c","text":"New organizations reporting from 2017: CTBTO, ICC and UNFCCC; from 2018: IARC and OPCW; from 2019: ITLOS; from 2021: ISA and UNCCD; and from 2022: IRMCT.","pdfPage":30,"years":[2022,2023]},{"marker":"d","text":"UNFCCC has two budgets approved by the Conference of the Parties to the Convention; both are financed from indicative (assessed) contributions with different scales of assessment and different membership.","pdfPage":30,"years":[2022,2023]},{"marker":"e","text":"UN Tourism: The collection rate refers to assessed contributions from full members and associate members, excluding the collection rate of contributions from affiliate members. Total contributions include all members’ contributions due to the General Fund and due to the Working Capital Fund.","pdfPage":30,"years":[2022,2023]},{"marker":"f","text":"ITLOS: The percentages given relate to the collected/assessed contributions for the 2023 financial period, while the outstanding amount of 1.1 million euros reported includes previous financial periods.","pdfPage":30,"years":[2023]},{"marker":"g","text":"WIPO: The percentage collection is based on 2023 assessments, while the total of all outstanding reported amounts includes the balances for prior years.","pdfPage":30,"years":[2023]},{"marker":"h","text":"UNESCO: The figure reported includes the pro rata assessed contribution due from the United States of America, which was paid in 2023 (the United States rejoined UNESCO on 10 July 2023).","pdfPage":30,"years":[2023]},{"marker":"i","text":"United Nations peacekeeping: The financial statements of the United Nations peacekeeping operations (A/78/5 (Vol. II), chap. V) are for the fiscal year from 1 July 2022 to 30 June 2023. The total outstanding amount of $2.5 billion is as at 30 June 2023 and excludes the allowance for doubtful accounts.","pdfPage":30,"years":[2023]}]},"organizations":[{"entity":"UN Secretariat","sourceEntity":"United Nations","sourceRow":1,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":329657769,"asOf":"2022-12-31","asOfBasis":"table_header","asOfSourcePdfPage":29,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2022-12-31","notes":[],"pdfPage":29,"rawOutstanding":"329 657 769"},{"entity":"Peacekeeping Operations","sourceEntity":"United Nations peacekeeping","sourceRow":2,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":2291818184,"asOf":null,"asOfBasis":"uncertain","asOfSourcePdfPage":29,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2022-12-31","notes":["The column heading gives 31 December, but the reporting date of this peacekeeping balance is not explicitly established by the table notes."],"pdfPage":29,"rawOutstanding":"2 291 818 184"},{"entity":"CTBTO","sourceEntity":"CTBTO","sourceRow":3,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":43652720,"asOf":"2022-12-31","asOfBasis":"table_header","asOfSourcePdfPage":29,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2022-12-31","notes":[],"pdfPage":29,"rawOutstanding":"43 652 720"},{"entity":"FAO","sourceEntity":"FAO","sourceRow":4,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":171496931,"asOf":"2022-12-31","asOfBasis":"table_header","asOfSourcePdfPage":29,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2022-12-31","notes":[],"pdfPage":29,"rawOutstanding":"171 496 931"},{"entity":"IAEA","sourceEntity":"IAEA","sourceRow":5,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":85829068,"asOf":"2022-12-31",